          "explanation": "South is on lead after winning DA and holds CA CK C8 C6 C4 opposite CQ C7 C2. Four club tricks plus the five outside winners suffice.",
          "quotes": [
            "Cash the club ace to begin establishing the four club tricks needed for the contract, watching both defenders' cards."
          ]
        }
      ]
