          "explanation": "North is void in clubs and holds D8 D6 plus HK H7 H4. Discarding D6 on South's established C6 leaves the heart communication intact.",
          "quotes": [
            "Discard another low diamond, keeping the heart king and heart communications intact while South cashes the last club."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "decision-0013",
      "status": "pass",
      "findings": [
        {
          "dimension": "cashout feasibility",
          "fact": "DK followed by SA and both top hearts is a feasible ten-trick cashout.",
          "explanation": "Declarer has six tricks and South is on lead with DK SA HA H6 H3. North retains HK H7 H4, permitting HA followed by a low heart to HK.",
          "quotes": [
            "Cash the diamond king while in hand, then collect the spade ace and both top hearts for ten tricks."
