          "explanation": "Declarer has seven tricks. South holds SA HA H6 H3 and North HK H7 H4, so SA, HA and a low heart to HK are available.",
          "quotes": [
            "Cash the spade ace, then the heart ace and king to secure ten tricks."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
