          "explanation": "North holds S8 S6 S2 and South's SA is unbeatable. This trick raises declarer's total from seven to eight; HA and HK remain available for ten.",
          "quotes": [
            "Play the lowest spade under South’s ace, preserving dummy’s higher spades. The two top hearts will then secure ten tricks."
          ]
