          "explanation": "Declarer has ten tricks. The remaining opposing spades are SK SQ ST, all above South's S9 S4 and North's S8 S6. HQ remains outstanding above H7 H6. S6 is a legal exit.",
          "quotes": [
            "Ten tricks are secured. Lead a spade; the defenders’ remaining spades outrank ours, and the heart queen is still outstanding.",
